# ── JARVIS OS — Environment ────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in ONE provider to unlock a
# real language model. Every value is optional: with no keys, JARVIS
# runs on its built-in Local Core (desktop control, timers, memory).
#
# SECURITY
# - These variables are read only inside /api/jarvis (server-side).
# - Keys are never sent to the browser and never stored in the
#   browser or in desktop snapshots.
# - .env.local is git-ignored. Never commit a real key.
# - Restart `npm run dev` after changing this file; Next.js does not
#   hot-reload environment variables.
#
# Copy, then uncomment and fill the provider you want.

# ── Google Gemini (recommended starting point) ────────────────
# Create a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Default model: gemini-3.8-flash (set in Settings → Intelligence)
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Accepted alias for the same key:
# GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=

# ── OpenAI ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# ── Anthropic ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── Groq ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# ── OpenRouter ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# ── Ollama (local models — no API key) ────────────────────────
# Install from https://ollama.com/download, then `ollama pull llama3.2`
# Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:11434 if unset; override only if needed.
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=

# ── Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint ────────────────────────────
# LM Studio, vLLM, Together, DeepSeek, etc.
# CUSTOM_AI_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/v1
# CUSTOM_AI_API_KEY=

# ── Web search (Tavily) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Lets the connected model look things up and cite sources. Optional:
# without a key JARVIS says live search is unavailable instead of guessing.
# Create a key at https://app.tavily.com  (free tier available)
# The endpoint is fixed in code (https://api.tavily.com/search) and is
# never read from the browser. Queries are sent to Tavily; keys are not.
TAVILY_API_KEY=
